0..77 Comment "//! A buffer\'s region ended under its pending completion: buffers passed to a"
78..156 Comment "//! read \"must remain valid until completion\" (io_uring(7)), so the region the"
157..235 Comment "//! buffer lives in may not end while the submission that holds it is pending."
236..313 Comment "//! The kernel is a forked peer, which no region bounds, so a submission that"
314..391 Comment "//! carries a value kept in a region is refused where the kernel is forked. A"
392..449 Comment "//! region is a static extent erased before anything runs"
450..502 Comment "//! [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]."
503..506 Comment "//!"
507..567 Comment "//! - cites: [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]"
